CORE
slash-bash.sh
--resolve-dynamic-sites
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
^\[shell-dynamic-site\.1\] .* a name with /: SUCCESS$
^\[assertion\.1\] .* "\$\{reached\}" = yes: SUCCESS$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
A resolution to the names with a slash still calls a function whose name
has a slash.
